   "snippet": "If you're looking for perfectly smoked- with the fat beautifully rendered- brisket, and excellent mac n cheese, and glorious beef sausage, at a blink-and-you'll-miss-it place in Austin, Texas, you have found it at Brown's BBQ.\n\nEvery bite a melt-in-your-mouth delight. Each morsel a must-eat.\n\nAnd the BBQ sauce was tangy and great, too.\n\nI'm going to update this now, as we have finished eating our way through Austin and inform you that this is the significantly best texture for brisket that we have ever had.",
   "extracted_snippet": {
    "original": "If you're looking for perfectly smoked- with the fat beautifully rendered- brisket, and excellent mac n cheese, and glorious beef sausage, at a blink-and-you'll-miss-it place in Austin, Texas, you have found it at Brown's BBQ.\n\nEvery bite a melt-in-your-mouth delight. Each morsel a must-eat.\n\nAnd the BBQ sauce was tangy and great, too.\n\nI'm going to update this now, as we have finished eating our way through Austin and inform you that this is the significantly best texture for brisket that we have ever had."
   },
