   "extracted_snippet": {
    "original": "Bbq food truck. When you order brisket sandwich,  they ask you if you want it marbled or lean. That's a nice gesture. The food overall was good. I liked the marbled brisket better. Mac n cheese is on point. On the sandwich, I would definitely get the bbq sauce on it and not on the side. I liked that there's parking in that shopping strip. That's convenient for Austin."
   },
